IBM Carbon icons, @carbon/icons 11.90.0 (https://github.com/carbon-design-system/carbon,
packages/icons, the 32-unit SVGs in svg/32/), Apache License 2.0, LICENSE beside this file.
Copyright IBM Corp. Only the glyphs the chrome draws are kept. Each file was changed from the
published one: its <title>, its transparent box and any knocked-out inner path (fill="none")
are dropped, its circles and transformed shapes are turned into plain path data with the
transforms applied, its numbers are rounded to four places, and its markup is put on one line.
The drawing is otherwise Carbon's.

